{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JjqLJ1vVsUQ7nBi115T771","type":"tool_result","content":"## head\nok  \tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/pose\t0.012s\n--- FAIL: TestRunContinuityInterruptedResumeAndAccounting (0.15s)\n        Error: delegated run history incomplete: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours\n--- FAIL: TestRunContinuityDoctorStatusAndPending (0.19s)\n            \"task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours\"\nFAIL\nFAIL\tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/cli\t2.871s\nok  \tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/mcpserver\t0.012s\nFAIL\n## reverted\nok  \tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/pose\t0.013s\n--- FAIL: TestRunContinuityInterruptedResumeAndAccounting (0.18s)\n        Error: delegated run history incomplete: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours\n--- FAIL: TestRunContinuityDoctorStatusAndPending (0.19s)\n            \"task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours\"\nFAIL\nFAIL\tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/cli\t3.582s\nok  \tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/mcpserver\t0.011s\nFAIL","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"[private-session]","uuid":"98ecfde5-2f36-48ee-b5b4-ed53fcf60300","timestamp":"2026-11-26T21:12:07.379Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## head\nok  \tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/pose\t0.012s\n--- FAIL: TestRunContinuityInterruptedResumeAndAccounting (0.15s)\n        Error: delegated run history incomplete: task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours\n--- FAIL: TestRunContinuityDoctorStatusAndPending (0.19s)\n            \"task runs: pose: /home belongs to another user; set XDG_STATE_HOME to a private directory of yours\"\nFAIL\nFAIL\tgithub.com/harne8/pose-mcp/internal/